        "text_preview": "The further challenge is Judgment and Order dated 24.12.2002 passed by the learned Additional Sessions Judge, Sonitpur, Tezpur in Criminal Appeal No. 18(S-4)/1998,\nwhereby the learned Appellate Court dismissed the appeal and upheld the conv"
