        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n3. Referring to the decision of the Hon'ble Apex Court in the case of M/s A.K.Sarkar & Co. & Anr.\n-Vs- The State of West Bengal & Ors reported in 2024 INSC 186 , Mr. Jain, learned counsel for the petitioners argues that the sentence prescr"
